      <version name="0.9.0-beta7" author="Psysia" time="2026-09-16T04:11:36Z">
        <changelog><![CDATA[
- Adds a separate AI semantic search entry point with a gold toolbar button and Ctrl+Shift+F shortcut.
- Supports DeepSeek, OpenAI, and custom OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions endpoints and models.
- Recalls up to 120 candidates locally, then sends only bounded filename and metadata fields for semantic reranking; audio and full paths are never uploaded.
- Encrypts the API key for the current Windows user with DPAPI and keeps it out of normal configuration, backups, logs, and command lines.
- Adds AI relevance results, progress, cancellation, connection testing, timeout cleanup, and safe local fallback.
        ]]></changelog>
