      <version name="0.9.0-beta6" author="Psysia" time="2026-09-15T10:06:32Z">
        <changelog><![CDATA[
- Expands optional neural similarity to common WAV sample rates and bit depths, AIFF, FLAC, MP3, and M4A.
- Uses in-memory downmixing and resampling without creating converted audio copies.
